      "message": "Are you sure this isn\u0027t a security fix that should be present in the kernel and any needed adjustments made to userspace as well?\n\nI have heard from other device vendors that this did break things as you reported, but they made the needed userspace changes instead to resolve the issue.  I am not qualified to determine if this is a security issue here or not, so you might want to determine that first before we take this revert.",
